n-alcoholic fatty liver disease; ALN-APOC3 for dyslipidemia; ALN-CIDEB for metabolic dysfunction-associated steatohepatitis; ALN-HTT02 for Huntington's disease; ALN-5288 for Alzheimer's disease; ALN-SOD for SOD1 amyotrophic lateral sclerosis; ALN-SNCA for Parkinson's disease; AG-236 for polycythemia vera; ALN-CFB for paroxysmal nocturnal hemoglobinuria; ALN-BCAT for hepatocellular carcinoma; and ALN-4285, ALN-4915, and ALN-F1202 for healthy volunteers. The company has collaborations with Regeneron Pharmaceuticals, Inc.; Roche Holding AG; Sanofi S.A.; Novartis AG; PeptiDream, Inc; Dicerna Pharmaceuticals, Inc.; and Ionis Pharmaceuticals, Inc. Alnylam Pharmaceuticals, Inc. was founded in 2002 and is headquartered in Cambridge, Massachusetts.","employees":2500,"website":"https://www.alnylam.com","country":"United States","city":"Cambridge","officers":[{"name":"Dr. Yvonne L. Greenstreet M.B.A., M.D.","title":"CEO & Director"},{"name":"Dr. Phillip A. Sharp Ph.D.","title":"Co-Founder, Member of the Scientific Advisory Board"},{"name":"Mr. Jeffrey V. Poulton M.B.A.","title":"CFO & Executive VP"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":18.93,"tpe":29.94,"ps":4.243,"pfcf":28.07,"peg":1.36,"pb":4.477,"ev_ebitda":16.75,"rev_growth":0.1,"eps_growth":0.167,"eps_growth_fwd":0.0928,"eps_growth_next":0.1205,"div_yield":0,"roe":0.01454,"roa":0.02187,"de":41.94,"gross_margin":0.4983,"op_margin":0.04015,"profit_margin":0,"current_ratio":3.084},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":18.36,"sector":18.93,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":38.24,"sector":29.94,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":6.317,"sector":4.243,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":111.8,"sector":28.07,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":0.29,"sector":1.36,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":22.4,"sector":4.477,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":220.6,"sector":41.94,"verdi